      ],
      "source": "https://www.usna.edu/USNAHistory/index.php"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Renamed United States Naval Academy in 1850, it added a four‑year curriculum and on‑ship training.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://navalacademytourism.com/blog/usna-memory-lane"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "First women entered the Academy in 1976 after Congress opened all service academies to them.",
